+The full input graph is saved in `original_conflict_graph_*.csv`. The downstream `conflict_graph_*.csv` tables describe the reduced solver graph, so reconstruction and MILP use the reduced components consistently. Dominated contacts are removed alternatives and are never added back to the schedule. Removal witnesses are saved for independent validation.--- original/cell_8
